    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*, *cough*... Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you had to take me up Mount T'ien.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Consumpted Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take this spot under the sunshine. You sit over there. You're in much better health than I am. The least you could do is offer me this spot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Consumpted Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#5$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming out here for a stroll, some sunlight, and the water from the springs of Mount T'ien will do your health much good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ridiculous. It's been decades since we've so much as run into one another outside the palace walls, and you still invited me on this trip.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were the first to grow tired of sitting around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not easy to sit still for so long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yumen, Dahuang. We need an explanation for this string of events.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I am behind all of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I abetted the Yumen Shanhaizhong, and I let Ya in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this enough to drag me down? If you want more, here. I let Wang escape the capital. I sent the girl to Victoria. I instigated the demonic calamity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you must open another vacancy in the court, you can pin all of this on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Shanhaizhong are a bunch of thugs. How could they possibly amount to anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ya was merely a sickly beast. It took only a few dozen to a hundred Tianshis to deal with. It was just perfect as the meal served to awaken the Sui.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But certainly nothing to write home about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*... *cough*... Phew... In the end, I'm a sickly old man, too. This is the only use my life has left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've never been troubled by things going out of hand. No, you're never troubled by anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is much that troubles me... I'm afraid of the unpredictable, sinister human mind. I am troubled by the trends I've seen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Going with the tide. One man pulling at each end. It's all for balance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now the convict has toppled the weiqi board. Is it still possible to sue for peace?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yumen's repairs are complete, and it is on its way to the capital. Grand Tutor, please make up your mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
