    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A letter of reinstatement...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shouldn't have been the one to deliver this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "The imperial court is already aware of the Dahuang affair and the acts of the two perpetrators.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, the Sui Regulator, the Tianshi Bureaus, the Six Ministries... All of them are in a frantic mess. I happened to be passing by Dahuang on business, so I lent them a hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was Mother who asked you to come, am I correct...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Duoxie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems the court has come to a conclusion regarding the crisis instigated by the proxies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yumen's repairs are complete, and it has started sailing toward the capital once more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, it comes to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're rather calm. I thought you'd be yapping how much you want to head back to the front lines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lately, I've been trying to comprehend a certain wisdom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is because we fear that we are anxious... The more we are afraid of facing an unknown enemy, the stronger our urge to charge toward it. All for the sake of giving ourselves an explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm not afraid anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "The proxies may have the ability to bend Heaven and earth, but in the end, they, too, have human emotion. In that sense, they are not different at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our 'opponents' are not untouchable. And so, there is nothing to be afraid of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
