    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Lord Zuo, I have no intention of becoming your enemy. However, I do hope you take what I said to heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "The days ahead of us are long, and there shall come a time when we meet again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not bad. Seems General Zuo didn't send you here for nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am ready for deployment. Where should I go? Yumen? Baizao?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be so hasty. We'll have you get back to your old role.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a place that comes into contact with the proxies quite frequently. The court isn't completely oblivious to them, but per protocol, the Sui Regulator should launch an investigation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
