    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're leaving?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "These seeds. Some of them sprouted, and their Originium resistance is much higher than anticipated. It's time to take them to the fields outside for further cultivation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't that be tough?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's no different from what I do in Dahuang.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... When are you coming back, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, I need to take the seeds to the grain cultivation bases all across the country and produce the first test crops. Then, based on how they adapt to different soils, develop a suitable cultivation method.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It might take more than ten generations to get accurate results. It might... be a while...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... One generation takes a year. Ten years... That's really long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's long enough for Mianmian to get as big as his parents... Maybe it's not actually that long. After we switched to the new feed, the stockbeasts all started to grow really quickly. Like, it's like they double in size every day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But ten years. That means waiting for the wanghuaguo trees to grow those sour fruits ten times... When I think about it that way, that kind of feels like an eternity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*, let me see you off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grain Buds"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
