    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jiangnan."
    },
    {
        "text": "Dage once told me that he wanted to travel to Jiangnan after leaving his post."
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been centuries since he last had a taste of Jiangnan's summertime water chestnuts. And since he has gotten so used to the sight of the yellow sands, perhaps he should enjoy some rest in a quaint, riverside town. Careful, though. Don't break this painting."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ling was never able to forget that desert."
    },
    {
        "text": "She doesn't actually like war. She simply likes how valiant warriors look on the battlefield... Who wouldn't?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The flames of war do not burn in the painting. There is only a column of smoke rising in the vast desert, as the sun sets on the endless river. Enjoy your drink in peace there, and be the poet you want to be."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g03_yandowntown_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nian loves lively places, but a place like Shangshu is a better fit for her than Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "text": "You stay there and don't bother me again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_indoor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Erge... I should've painted him a weiqi board, and nothing more."
    },
    {
        "text": "Calculating emotions and terrible aesthetic sensibilities... This garden is yours. I don't want to ever have to see your face again."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, you didn't give yourself a way out. Heh..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g08_pavilion",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jie..."
    },
    {
        "text": "If it wasn't for your constant nagging and you playing the older sister card the whole time, I really would've asked you to teach me calligraphy."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This will do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Despite all the effort I put into it, who knows if these paintings will remain when everyone wakes from their dreams?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does it really matter either way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you have visited a place and seen all its sights, everything is but a pipe dream. What more fun is there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "With all of you here, I am not lonely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The painter sets her brush down and withdraws."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wing"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sky is as clear as a blank scroll. A flock of fowlbeasts flies past."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
