    {
        "text": "How does it fit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the only cloth I have. If you rip it, I couldn't get you another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "It fits perfectly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps it's too late for me to ask. But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you think your chances are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "A life and death struggle. This game will be decided by a mere half point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the sound of it, you could easily lose everything... and you are beyond the point of no return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "When will you make your move?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything is ready. All we need...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wang"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I will come see you soon.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When you open your eyes and see the pattern on this robe, will you remember how you felt back then?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "A thousand years ago. That fear deep inside our souls. That disgrace etched into our bones.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "You'd best remember.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I will come see you very soon.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
