    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Shu, our fields have yielded nothing for a few years. Can we really still grow crops here? We can still plant food, if we use the right methods?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Each field has a different plant suited to it. You need to use the most appropriate method to improve the soil.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plant these seeds here. You'll see results by autumn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_140#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you from, Shu?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look pretty young, but you know so much about the fields... Are you maybe a Tianshi from the Bureaus? What exactly is a Tianshi anyway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're people who study specialized knowledge and pass it on to others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_140#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's something...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please keep working, by all means. I'll go get you a glass of water.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Mallow-lush the seventh month, the ninth bid weaving winter clothes. Here comes spring to bring the sun, and warbling of orioles...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nine! was time to lay the garden out, and ten! to reap the joy of harvest gains. Plant your Millets lest Year end, with hemp and beans and all the grains...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
