    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Mallow-lush the seventh month, the ninth bid weaving winter clothes.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Winter comes early in Dahuang. We need to ready ourselves some proper clothes soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "My dear sister, should I make you a set of new clothes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't need it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've developed a new weaving method, which yields satins that are light, durable, and colorful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a new design thought out, and I'm certain it will look perfect on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, whatever floats your boat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shu...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this how <i>man</i> lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "It does seem... rather pleasant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
