    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My good gentleman, I know by heart the wisdom of commerce that you've taught me, but there remains one thing that I do not understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "All things under Heaven are fleeting and indistinct. How should I appraise them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look. How much is the jade pendant I'm wearing worth?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know this pendant. It is very common and worth at most two taels of silver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this pendant was left to me by my mother. I have been carrying it around for as long as I can remember. To me, it is priceless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, appraisal means appraising the human heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I shall remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's almost summer... Just the season for Jiangnan lychees.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The climate is dry up north. The lychees there are hardly sweet, and simply don't compare to the lychees back home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I would go back home and open a trade route for selling the southern lychees up north, only for there to be a river standing in my way, stopping me from ever going back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a shame that this rain came at a terrible time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It will be summer in two days. Once your body warms up, we will hire a boat to cross the river.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it... I know in my heart that this is the end of the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why must man always go against Heaven...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "How old are you this year?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ages are not very meaningful to my kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if we must, I will be exactly fifty, come Xiaoshu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can tell you are not quite the same as mere mortals... I envy your long life. Still, now that I consider it, such a long life would be full of hardship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what you are, I am eighty-three. You have followed me for so long. It certainly wouldn't be a bad deal for you, if I called you my adopted son.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, I was fortunate to have met you and seen the boundless sights these lands have to offer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fate brought us together. I have nothing much to give you. Aside from that worthless business, this one mantra is all I have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All under Heaven live for profit, and die for profit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have been reciting this mantra from the day I began studying business, and it helped me triumph over many rivals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if everything under Heaven could really be summed up with just the word 'profit', this might just be a rather boring place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have much time left and can't walk much farther. If you truly have such a long life ahead of you, then go and see for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Walk this great land. Go and see for me whether there is really some kind of 'great windfall' that profits all under Heaven.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you truly do find it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I will remember...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will go and see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
